<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">To the distant light above,</font></b></font></font>

27
00:01:14,020 --> 00:01:17,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">ON THE WAY</font></b></font></font>

28
00:01:14,020 --> 00:01:17,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">yes, we are on the way!</font></b></font></font>

29
00:01:21,890 --> 00:01:28,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">I WANNA ROCKS mune ni ROCKS</font></b></font></font>

30
00:01:21,890 --> 00:01:28,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">I wanna rock... Rockin' my heart...</font></b></font></font>

31
00:01:41,580 --> 00:01:42,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it!</font>

32
00:01:42,790 --> 00:01:46,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Where'd he attack from?!
Is it the clones?</font>

33
00:01:49,420 --> 00:01:51,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Where's the real body?!</font>

34
00:01:52,250 --> 00:01:54,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's useless for you to even attempt
following with your eyes.</font>

35
00:01:54,920 --> 00:01:57,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I absolutely will not be caught.</font>

36
00:01:57,590 --> 00:02:00,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Humph. Shadow Clone Jutsu!</font>

37
00:02:00,260 --> 00:02:01,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't!</font>

38
00:02:13,190 --> 00:02:15,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is a teleportation Jutsu that</font>

39
00:02:15,780 --> 00:02:18,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">uses mirrors that can
reflect only my image.</font>

40
00:02:19,160 --> 00:02:20,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Watching you from the speed I move,</font>

41
00:02:21,070 --> 00:02:23,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it almost seems as if
you aren't moving at all...</font>

42
00:02:25,080 --> 00:02:26,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I knew it!</font>

43
00:02:26,660 --> 00:02:29,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is that Jutsu...
the Kekkei Genkai?!</font>

44
00:02:31,500 --> 00:02:33,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kekkei... Genkai...?</font>

45
00:02:34,460 --> 00:02:36,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's the same type as
my Sharingan...</font>

46
00:02:37,470 --> 00:02:38,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then...!</font>

47
00:02:38,760 --> 00:02:39,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right...</font>

48
00:02:40,220 --> 00:02:44,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's impossible even for me
to copy that Jutsu...</font>

49
00:02:45,060 --> 00:02:47,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And there's no way to destroy
that Jutsu, either!</font>

50
00:02:52,060 --> 00:02:52,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it...</font>

51
00:02:54,230 --> 00:02:56,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So... What?!</font>

52
00:02:57,530 --> 00:03:00,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't die here yet.</font>

53
00:03:00,820 --> 00:03:04,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">'Cause I have a dream
that I must turn into reality...</font>

54
00:03:04,240 --> 00:03:07,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The dream to have my strength
recognized by everyone in the village...</font>

55
00:03:07,950 --> 00:03:10,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and become the Hokage!</font>

56
00:03:11,790 --> 00:03:12,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Dream...</font>

57
00:03:15,840 --> 00:03:21,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I, for the sake of my dream.
And you, for the sake of your dream.</font>

58
00:03:22,430 --> 00:03:24,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please don't hold it against me.</font>

59
00:03:24,890 --> 00:03:27,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I want to protect someone
special to me...</font>

60
00:03:28,310 --> 00:03:32,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I work for the sake of that person,
I fight for that person,</font>

61
00:03:32,690 --> 00:03:35,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and I want to make that
person's dream a reality...</font>

62
00:03:35,360 --> 00:03:36,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's my dream.</font>

63
00:03:37,190 --> 00:03:40,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">For the sake of that dream
I will completely become a Shinobi,</font>

64
00:03:40,570 --> 00:03:43,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and kill you guys!</font>

65
00:03:50,750 --> 00:03:56,790
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">The Battle with</font>

66
00:03:50,750 --> 00:03:56,790
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Zero</font>

67
00:03:50,750 --> 00:03:56,790
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Visib-
ility</font>

68
00:03:50,750 --> 00:03:56,790
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">the</font>

69
00:03:50,750 --> 00:03:56,790
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Sharin-</font>

70
00:03:50,750 --> 00:03:56,790
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">gan</font>

71
00:03:50,750 --> 00:03:56,790
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Destroyer</font>

72
00:04:00,920 --> 00:04:05,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun! Naruto!
Don't lose to a guy like that!</font>

73
00:04:05,220 --> 00:04:07,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stop it, Sakura. Don't goad him!</font>

74
00:04:08,100 --> 00:04:08,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?</font>

75
00:04:09,520 --> 00:04:13,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even if there was a chance that
we could break that technique,</font>

76
00:04:13,350 --> 00:04:16,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">they won't be able to defeat that boy.</font>

77
00:04:17,820 --> 00:04:19,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-What do you mean?</font>

78
00:04:22,450 --> 00:04:25,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They don't have the mentality
to kill their feelings...</font>

79
00:04:25,530 --> 00:04:27,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and kill another person!</font>

80
00:04:29,620 --> 00:04:33,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That boy really knows
the agony of being a Shinobi.</font>

81
00:04:34,790 --> 00:04:36,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's different from Naruto and Sasuke.</font>

82
00:04:37,250 --> 00:04:38,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Exactly...</font>

83
00:04:39,340 --> 00:04:45,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No real Shinobi will come out of
a peace-addicted village like yours.</font>

84
00:04:46,890 --> 00:04:49,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Because they are not able
to learn</font>

85
00:04:49,850 --> 00:04:52,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the most important "experience of killing"!</font>

86
00:04:55,440 --> 00:04:56,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then...</font>

87
00:04:56,520 --> 00:04:57,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then...</font>

88
00:04:57,400 --> 00:04:59,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are we going to do, Sensei?!</font>

89
00:05:02,990 --> 00:05:05,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If I go over to
Naruto and Sasuke,</font>

90
00:05:06,030 --> 00:05:08,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tazuna-san will be in danger.</font>

91
00:05:09,490 --> 00:05:11,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even if I try the Shadow Clones.</font>

92
00:05:15,460 --> 00:05:18,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He'll come to stop me with
his Water Clones.</font>

93
00:05:19,500 --> 00:05:21,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll just be wasting Chakra.</font>

94
00:05:22,460 --> 00:05:23,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then...</font>

95
00:05:24,340 --> 00:05:26,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sorry but...</font>

96
00:05:28,220 --> 00:05:31,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm going to have to finish
this in an instant.</font>

97
00:05:32,390 --> 00:05:33,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sharingan?!</font>

98
00:05:35,560 --> 00:05:37,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Sharingan again?</font>

99
00:05:37,270 --> 00:05:39,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Such an unimaginative guy!</font>

100
00:05:58,540 --> 00:05:59,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sensei!</font>

101
00:06:06,300 --> 00:06:08,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You might call me "an unimaginative guy,"</font>

102
00:06:09,090 --> 00:06:12,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but you are afraid of the Sharingan,
after all... Zabuza!</font>

103
00:06:15,310 --> 00:06:17,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The secret technique of a Shinobi...</font>

104
00:06:17,560 --> 00:06:21,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">isn't something that you show
your opponent so many times.</font>

105
00:06:21,400 --> 00:06:22,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Be appreciative.</font>

106
00:06:22,770 --> 00:06:27,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're the only who has had
the chance to see it twice...</font>

107
00:06:28,030 --> 00:06:30,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And there will be no third time...</font>

108
00:06:32,990 --> 00:06:38,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even if you were able to defeat me,
you can't defeat Haku...</font>

109
00:06:38,460 --> 00:06:39,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What...?</font>

110
00:06:43,290 --> 00:06:45,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kakashi-sensei can't win?</font>

111
00:06:46,170 --> 00:06:48,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That boy in the mask is that strong?</font>

112
00:06:49,260 --> 00:06:52,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Since he was a kid, I have been
painstakingly teaching him</font>

113
00:06:52,800 --> 00:06:55,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the battle techniques of the Ninja!</font>

114
00:07:14,240 --> 00:07:17,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All of my techniques.</font>

115
00:07:21,120 --> 00:07:22,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">On top of that...</font>

116
00:07:22,460 --> 00:07:25,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">he has been polishing up
his own skills as well!</font>

117
00:07:28,630 --> 00:07:30,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As a result...</font>

118
00:07:30,550 --> 00:07:32,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He has...</font>

119
00:07:32,890 --> 00:07:36,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">no matter how unbelievably difficult
his predicament,</font>

120
00:07:37,260 --> 00:07:39,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">been extremely successful.</font>

121
00:07:42,980 --> 00:07:47,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He has no "heart" and has
abandoned the notion of "life."</font>

122
00:07:47,980 --> 00:07:50,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He is a fighting machine
known as a Shinobi.</font>

123
00:07:54,070 --> 00:07:56,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Not only that,
his Jutsu surpasses mine!</font>

124
00:07:57,740 --> 00:08:01,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The terrifying ability of
the Kekkei Genkai.</font>

125
00:08:02,460 --> 00:08:05,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In other words,
I have acquired a sophisticated tool.</font>

126
00:08:06,340 --> 00:08:09,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Unlike the scrap you're
carrying around.</font>

127
00:08:09,920 --> 00:08:13,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm not one to be afraid just
because I failed once!</font>

128
00:08:13,970 --> 00:08:15,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll do it as many times as it takes!</font>

129
00:08:16,010 --> 00:08:17,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Shadow Clone Jutsu!</font>

130
00:08:18,220 --> 00:08:18,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stop!</font>

131
00:08:52,920 --> 00:08:54,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-What the hell is it...?!</font>

132
00:08:58,050 --> 00:08:59,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I-It was just slight but...</font>

133
00:09:07,350 --> 00:09:09,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I could see the trails of his movements...</font>

134
00:09:10,190 --> 00:09:11,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">One more try!</font>

135
00:09:13,650 --> 00:09:15,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shadow Clone Jutsu!</font>

136
00:09:26,460 --> 00:09:29,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't you understand that it's useless?</font>

137
00:09:47,140 --> 00:09:48,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just because I see the trail,</font>

138
00:09:49,060 --> 00:09:51,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">doesn't mean that I can keep up
with his speed.</font>

139
00:09:57,200 --> 00:09:58,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The water...
is being repelled.</font>

140
00:10:01,990 --> 00:10:05,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But, what if that wasn't water...?</font>

141
00:10:07,290 --> 00:10:08,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right...</font>

142
00:10:08,960 --> 00:10:10,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The next one is going
to be my one shot!</font>

143
00:10:12,290 --> 00:10:14,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just because a bunch of scrap
got together</font>

144
00:10:14,340 --> 00:10:16,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">doesn't mean that
they can defeat Haku.</font>

145
00:10:16,670 --> 00:10:19,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He is....
He is the best tool!</font>

146
00:10:19,840 --> 00:10:23,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's nothing boring than
a stranger bragging...</font>

147
00:10:24,350 --> 00:10:27,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's about time...
I make my move.</font>

148
00:10:27,350 --> 00:10:30,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now wait.
As long as we're talking...</font>

149
00:10:30,230 --> 00:10:32,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let me brag about another thing...</font>

150
00:10:33,020 --> 00:10:33,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hmm?</font>

151
00:10:35,030 --> 00:10:36,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In the battle before,</font>

152
00:10:37,150 --> 00:10:41,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I didn't just let you defeat me
like a fool.</font>

153
00:11:00,090 --> 00:11:01,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's over...</font>

154
00:11:04,260 --> 00:11:06,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Haku, who was hiding in the corner,</font>

155
00:11:06,640 --> 00:11:10,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">was observing part of the battle.</font>

156
00:11:10,600 --> 00:11:12,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Haku is quite smart.</font>

157
00:11:12,900 --> 00:11:14,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">With his ability to analyze,</font>

158
00:11:14,360 --> 00:11:19,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">he is able to plan a counterattack
after observing a technique just once.</font>

159
00:11:20,820 --> 00:11:24,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've been anxious to copy your line.</font>

160
00:11:28,450 --> 00:11:33,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">"I'll tell you now, but the same Jutsu
won't work on me twice."</font>

161
00:11:33,330 --> 00:11:34,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Was that it...?</font>

162
00:11:36,960 --> 00:11:40,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ninja Art, Hidden Mist Jutsu!</font>

163
00:11:54,230 --> 00:11:57,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ninja Art, Hidden Mist Jutsu!</font>

164
00:12:08,830 --> 00:12:09,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is...?!</font>

165
00:12:20,590 --> 00:12:23,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is this...?
This really thick fog?</font>

166
00:12:24,220 --> 00:12:25,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The visibility is close to zero...</font>

167
00:12:26,220 --> 00:12:27,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sensei...!</font>

168
00:12:30,220 --> 00:12:32,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura! Stay with Tazuna-san!</font>

169
00:12:34,100 --> 00:12:35,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right.</font>

170
00:12:35,150 --> 00:12:38,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I have to trust Sasuke-kun,
Naruto and Kakashi-sensei right now...</font>

171
00:12:38,980 --> 00:12:41,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And I should do what I can do!</font>

172
00:12:42,150 --> 00:12:43,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

173
00:12:43,530 --> 00:12:45,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh! Sakura!</font>

174
00:12:46,410 --> 00:12:49,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tazuna-san, no matter what,
don't move away from me!</font>

175
00:12:50,120 --> 00:12:52,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah... I soo know it!</font>

176
00:12:56,500 --> 00:12:58,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I know...
Zabuza-san...</font>

177
00:12:59,250 --> 00:13:01,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll finish them off soon enough...</font>

178
00:13:05,720 --> 00:13:07,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shadow Clone Jutsu!</font>

179
00:13:10,930 --> 00:13:12,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You just don't learn, do you?!</font>

180
00:13:19,940 --> 00:13:21,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What? The Fire Style Jutsu!</font>

181
00:13:30,740 --> 00:13:33,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It takes... too long!</font>

182
00:14:08,030 --> 00:14:09,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is good!</font>

183
00:14:09,280 --> 00:14:11,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Bit by bit, I'm figuring out
the timing...</font>

184
00:14:22,840 --> 00:14:25,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I know it's called Hidden Mist,
but the fog is way too thick...</font>

185
00:14:26,630 --> 00:14:29,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even Zabuza himself shouldn't
be able to see anything...</font>

186
00:14:36,890 --> 00:14:38,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Good job on dodging it...</font>

187
00:14:38,890 --> 00:14:40,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just what I expect of Kakashi
of the Sharingan...</font>

188
00:14:47,570 --> 00:14:48,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's...</font>

189
00:14:48,700 --> 00:14:49,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">closing his eyes!</font>

190
00:14:50,410 --> 00:14:52,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But... the next time you see me,</font>

191
00:14:53,240 --> 00:14:55,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that'll be the end of it all...</font>

192
00:14:55,830 --> 00:14:58,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You overrate the Sharingan too much.</font>

193
00:14:58,910 --> 00:14:59,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What...?</font>

194
00:15:01,330 --> 00:15:05,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You spoke as if you saw through
everything, but...</font>

195
00:15:10,010 --> 00:15:11,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why?</font>

196
00:15:12,300 --> 00:15:15,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Could it be possible that
you can see the future...?!</font>

197
00:15:19,100 --> 00:15:20,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You are going to die.</font>

198
00:15:20,980 --> 00:15:24,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your foresight was wrong, after all.</font>

199
00:15:25,320 --> 00:15:26,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kakashi...</font>

200
00:15:26,730 --> 00:15:30,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You can't read my mind or
my future...</font>

201
00:15:30,780 --> 00:15:34,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Sharingan is merely a diversion
that makes you believe that!</font>

202
00:15:36,490 --> 00:15:38,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Those who have the Sharingan...</font>

203
00:15:39,000 --> 00:15:43,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">possess both
perceptive eyes and hypnotic eyes...</font>

204
00:15:47,130 --> 00:15:51,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Using these two powers and
bringing out Jutsus one after the other..</font>

205
00:15:51,880 --> 00:15:56,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you were just acting as if
you can read the future!</font>

206
00:15:59,810 --> 00:16:03,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">First with the perceptive eyes,
you copied my movement right away.</font>

207
00:16:05,110 --> 00:16:07,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And this is the Image
Replication Method.</font>

208
00:16:14,030 --> 00:16:16,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You first got me in
a ruffle with it...</font>

209
00:16:16,910 --> 00:16:19,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Once you make sure that
I'm flustered,</font>

210
00:16:19,830 --> 00:16:24,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you nail the "heart's voice."</font>

211
00:16:24,920 --> 00:16:27,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— This is the Mind Imitation Method.
— It's only an imitation, after all.</font>

212
00:16:28,460 --> 00:16:32,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— You can't defeat me! You monkey!
— You can't defeat me! You monkey!</font>

213
00:16:33,180 --> 00:16:35,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That imitating monkey mouth...</font>

214
00:16:35,220 --> 00:16:37,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll make sure that you won't be
able to open it any more!</font>

215
00:16:37,760 --> 00:16:38,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And...</font>

216
00:16:38,600 --> 00:16:41,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You judged the right timing when
my frustration was reaching its height</font>

217
00:16:42,310 --> 00:16:43,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-What is that?</font>

218
00:16:43,770 --> 00:16:46,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You set a clever trap.</font>

219
00:16:47,060 --> 00:16:48,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Me...?</font>

220
00:16:48,690 --> 00:16:50,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You used the Genjutsu with
your hypnotic eye and</font>

221
00:16:50,860 --> 00:16:55,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">made me weave the signs first...</font>

222
00:16:56,410 --> 00:16:59,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is the Jutsu Imitation Method...</font>

223
00:16:59,490 --> 00:17:01,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Giant Vortex Jutsu!</font>

224
00:17:12,840 --> 00:17:14,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">R-Ridiculous!</font>

225
00:17:17,340 --> 00:17:19,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then that makes it easier.</font>

226
00:17:20,260 --> 00:17:23,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">First vanish into the thick fog,</font>

227
00:17:23,270 --> 00:17:25,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and make your
perceptive eyes useless...</font>

228
00:17:26,270 --> 00:17:26,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

229
00:17:29,690 --> 00:17:31,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn! The guard is falling behind!</font>

230
00:17:32,480 --> 00:17:35,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I will close my eyes as well!</font>

231
00:17:36,530 --> 00:17:39,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I will shut off your ability to use
your hypnotic eye</font>

232
00:17:40,030 --> 00:17:41,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">in a close-distance battle.</font>

233
00:17:43,500 --> 00:17:44,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why?</font>

234
00:17:44,960 --> 00:17:47,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That also means that
you will lose your ability to see.</font>

235
00:17:48,460 --> 00:17:49,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Did you forget...?</font>

236
00:17:50,790 --> 00:17:53,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That I am a genius in Silent Killing,</font>

237
00:17:53,880 --> 00:17:58,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">a technique to find
the target just by sound.</font>

238
00:18:05,020 --> 00:18:08,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He read my movement...
No way could he do that.</font>

239
00:18:09,900 --> 00:18:12,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn! We were so close!</font>

240
00:18:12,610 --> 00:18:15,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto, can you still move?</font>

241
00:18:15,610 --> 00:18:18,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Of course! I'm totally fine!</font>

242
00:18:19,280 --> 00:18:22,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's pretty much spent...
and it's no wonder.</font>

243
00:18:22,780 --> 00:18:25,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shadow Clone Jutsu uses
a lot of Chakra.</font>

244
00:18:26,250 --> 00:18:28,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But thanks to him,
I found our way out.</font>

245
00:18:29,290 --> 00:18:30,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I found the way to break through!</font>

246
00:18:32,130 --> 00:18:34,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hah! Impossible!</font>

247
00:18:36,300 --> 00:18:39,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That was just a coincidence.</font>

248
00:18:43,430 --> 00:18:44,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto! Run!</font>

249
00:18:44,640 --> 00:18:45,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?</font>

250
00:18:45,470 --> 00:18:47,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Run out of here and
attack from the outside!</font>

251
00:18:49,100 --> 00:18:50,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A-All right!</font>

252
00:18:52,860 --> 00:18:54,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You won't be able to...!</font>

253
00:19:06,790 --> 00:19:08,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I-I'm not going to lose!</font>

254
00:19:11,330 --> 00:19:12,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There!</font>

255
00:19:12,290 --> 00:19:14,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fire Style: Fire Ball Jutsu!</font>

256
00:19:40,400 --> 00:19:41,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn!</font>

257
00:19:43,200 --> 00:19:44,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">T-That was good just now!</font>

258
00:19:44,570 --> 00:19:45,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?</font>

259
00:19:46,030 --> 00:19:47,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We're doing it one more time!</font>

260
00:19:49,080 --> 00:19:50,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right!</font>

261
00:19:54,000 --> 00:19:57,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's likely that there's a limit
to that guy's Chakra, too!</font>

262
00:19:58,460 --> 00:20:00,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To prove that,
he's little by little...</font>

263
00:20:06,100 --> 00:20:08,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This won't go as you've planned.</font>

264
00:20:09,730 --> 00:20:11,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">First, I'll get you!</font>

265
00:20:17,400 --> 00:20:18,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke!</font>

266
00:20:27,330 --> 00:20:32,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn! It's been a while since
I've fought in such bad conditions.</font>

267
00:20:33,790 --> 00:20:36,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And I'm worried about
Sasuke and Naruto, too...</font>

268
00:20:40,460 --> 00:20:46,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Be calm... Think...
What will he come after?</font>

269
00:20:47,600 --> 00:20:48,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh no!</font>

270
00:21:04,150 --> 00:21:05,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

271
00:21:05,610 --> 00:21:06,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Too late!</font>

272
00:21:33,440 --> 00:21:36,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Cultivate your hunger before you idealize.</font></b></font></font></font>

273
00:21:36,820 --> 00:21:40,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Motivate your anger to make them all realize.</font></b></font></font></font>

274
00:21:40,280 --> 00:21:43,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Climbing the mountain, never coming down.</font></b></font></font></font>

275
00:21:43,450 --> 00:21:47,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Break into the contents, never falling down.</font></b></font></font></font>

276
00:21:50,630 --> 00:21:53,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">My knee is still shaking, like I was twelve.</font></b></font></font></font>

277
00:21:53,880 --> 00:21:57,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Sneaking out of the classroom, by the back door.</font></b></font></font></font>

278
00:21:57,220 --> 00:22:00,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">A man railed at me twice though, but I didn't care.</font></b></font></font></font>

279
00:22:00,680 --> 00:22:04,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Waiting is wasting for people like me.</font></b></font></font></font>

280
00:22:04,350 --> 00:22:07,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Don't try to look so wise.</font></b></font></font></font>

281
00:22:07,350 --> 00:22:10,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Don't cry 'cause you're so right.</font></b></font></font></font>

282
00:22:10,810 --> 00:22:14,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Don't dry with fakes or fears,</font></b></font></font></font>

283
00:22:14,400 --> 00:22:18,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">'Cause you will hate yourself in the end.</font></b></font></font></font>

284
00:22:27,370 --> 00:22:30,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#dfe9ed">Don't try to look so wise.</font></b></font></font></font>

285
00:22:30,710 --> 00:22:34,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#dfe9ed">Don't cry 'cause you're so right.</font></b></font></font></font>

286
00:22:34,090 --> 00:22:37,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#dfe9ed">Don't dry with fakes or fears,</font></b></font></font></font>

287
00:22:37,420 --> 00:22:41,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#dfe9ed">'Cause you will hate yourself in the end.</font></b></font></font></font>

288
00:22:41,050 --> 00:22:44,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#dfe9ed">Don't try to look so wise.</font></b></font></font></font>

289
00:22:44,510 --> 00:22:47,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#dfe9ed">Don't cry 'cause you're so right.</font></b></font></font></font>

290
00:22:47,810 --> 00:22:50,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#dfe9ed">Don't dry...</font></b></font></font></font>

291
00:22:53,100 --> 00:22:55,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Why? Why is it?</font>

292
00:22:56,350 --> 00:22:58,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Why did this happen?</font>

293
00:22:59,350 --> 00:23:05,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">I never asked for your help!
I hated you!</font>

